WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Build-versus-buy compares total cost, time, capability, risk and service—not just the visible purchase price.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Add tooling, labor, inspection and rework to an in-house option before comparing it with a supplier quote.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Decision matrix

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
These are teaching relationships, not live prices, quotes, tax advice or a forecast. State every assumption.

